---
import BaseLayout from '../../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Header from '../../../components/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../../../components/Footer.astro';
import Badge from '../../../components/Badge.astro';
import CTABand from '../../../components/CTABand.astro';

const nav = [
  { href: '/en/services/', label: 'Services' },
  { href: '/en/about/', label: 'About' },
  { href: '/en/homestock/', label: 'HomeStock' },
  { href: '/en/contact/', label: 'Contact' },
];
---

<BaseLayout
	lang="en"
	title="Case Study: Ubique Safety Consultants — Big Brain Solutions"
	description="A three-year web application development and support engagement for Ubique Safety Consultants."
>
	<Header lang="en" nav={nav} altLangHref="/studije-slucaja/ubique-safety-consultants/" altLangLabel="Hrvatski" />

	<main class="bb-case-study">
		<Badge variant="accent" class="mb-4">Case study</Badge>
		<h1>Ubique Safety Consultants</h1>
		<p class="bb-lead">A three-year web application engagement, still ongoing.</p>

		<blockquote class="bb-quote">
			<p>&ldquo;We worked on a web application project for three years. Gordan was very helpful, friendly, and provided support whenever we needed it. We're very satisfied with the collaboration.&rdquo;</p>
			<footer>— John Walkden, Managing Director, Ubique Safety Consultants</footer>
		</blockquote>

		<h2>The relationship</h2>
		<p>
			Ubique Safety Consultants engaged Big Brain Solutions to develop and maintain a web application for
			their safety consulting business. What started as a development project became a long-term
			partnership: three years of ongoing collaboration, with Gordan providing support whenever it was
			needed rather than handing off a finished product and disappearing.
		</p>

		<h2>Why this matters</h2>
		<p>
			A three-year client relationship is a better signal of reliability than any portfolio screenshot —
			it means the work held up, the client kept coming back, and the support was actually there when
			needed. That's the same standard every engagement is held to, whether it's a multi-year application
			build or a same-day repair.
		</p>

		<p class="bb-note">
			This case study is intentionally scoped to what's publicly verifiable right now. A fuller breakdown
			of the technical approach and outcomes is planned once full details are confirmed with the client.
		</p>

		<div class="bb-cta-wrap">
			<CTABand
				title="Looking for a long-term development partner?"
				description="If you need a web application built and supported for the long run, not just shipped and forgotten, let's talk."
				ctaLabel="Get in touch"
				ctaHref="/en/contact/?service=web-app-development"
			/>
		</div>
	</main>

	<Footer
		lang="en"
		nav={nav}
		privacyHref="/en/homestock-privacy-policy/"
		privacyLabel="Privacy (HomeStock)"
		labels={{
			address: 'Address',
			contact: 'Contact',
			hours: 'Hours',
			hoursValue: 'Mon–Sat 6am–6pm',
			rights: 'All rights reserved.',
			legalLine: 'BIG BRAIN SOLUTIONS, obrt za računalno programiranje, vl. Gordan Sentić · OIB (Tax ID): 71865731622',
		}}
	/>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
	.bb-case-study {
		max-width: 42rem;
		margin-inline: auto;
		padding: var(--spacing-section-mobile) 1.5rem;
	}

	.bb-lead {
		font-size: 1.125rem;
		color: var(--color-muted);
		font-family: var(--font-body);
		margin-top: 0.5rem;
	}

	.bb-quote {
		margin: 2rem 0;
		padding: 1.75rem;
		border-radius: var(--radius-card);
		border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
		background-color: var(--color-surface);
	}

	.bb-quote p {
		font-family: var(--font-body);
		font-size: 1.0625rem;
		line-height: 1.6;
	}

	.bb-quote footer {
		margin-top: 0.75rem;
		font-family: var(--font-body);
		font-size: var(--text-caption);
		color: var(--color-muted);
	}

	.bb-case-study h2 {
		margin-top: 2.5rem;
	}

	.bb-case-study p {
		font-family: var(--font-body);
		line-height: 1.75;
		margin-top: 1rem;
	}

	.bb-note {
		font-size: var(--text-caption);
		color: var(--color-muted);
		font-style: italic;
	}

	.bb-cta-wrap {
		margin-top: 3rem;
	}
</style>
